{"type":"example","type_name":"Example","number":"","title":"Echelon or not?","title_html":"Echelon or not?","html":"<p>Decide which of the following real matrices are in row echelon form,\nand which are in reduced row echelon form. Give the pivot columns where\nthey exist. <span class=\"math display\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\n\\mathbf{P} = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 &\n0 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}, \\quad\n\\mathbf{Q} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 5 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\n& 3 \\end{pmatrix}, \\quad\n\\mathbf{T} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\n& 0 \\end{pmatrix}, \\quad\n\\mathbf{Z} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}.\n\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D40F TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-stretchy-v style=\"height: 3.8em; vertical-align: -1.65em;\" class=\"mjx-c28\"><mjx-beg><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-beg><mjx-ext><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-ext><mjx-end><mjx-c></mjx-c></mjx-end><mjx-mark></mjx-mark></mjx-stretchy-v></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 4.278em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-left: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-r